  {
    "test_name": "v0.115.0 - Boolean Expansion::sectionWithTolerance",
    "bridge_function": "OCCTBooleanSectionWithTolerance",
    "bridge_output": {
      "type": "value",
      "data": {
        "done": true,
        "edges": 4,
        "vertices": 4,
        "controlEdges": 0,
        "controlVertices": 0
      }
    },
    "kernel_output": {
      "type": "value",
      "data": {
        "done": true,
        "edges": 4,
        "vertices": 4,
        "controlEdges": 0,
        "controlVertices": 0
      }
    },
    "comparison": {
      "equal": true,
      "differences": []
    },
    "status": "PASS",
    "source": "Same quantity on both sides: done and the distinct edge and vertex counts of the section between a 10 mm cube (0..10) and a second 10 mm cube at origin (10.001,0,0), a 0.001 gap between coincident-plane faces, at fuzzy 0.01, next to the same section at tolerance 0 (control* keys). At tolerance 0 the gap stands and the section is empty (no edge, no vertex); at 0.01 the two facing faces count as touching and their shared outline is the section, 4 edges and 4 vertices. The test asserts both. The earlier fixture (a centred first cube, the second at (5,5,5)) met at one corner and gave a single vertex and no edge, and the test asserted only a non-nil result. Bridge: Shape.section(with:tolerance:) non-nil (OCCTBooleanSectionWithTolerance) and subShapes(ofType: .edge/.vertex).count, each run on freshly built boxes. Kernel: BRepAlgoAPI_Section with SetFuzzyValue and Build, IsDone, TopExp::MapShapes edge and vertex counts; the sectionWithTolerance line of the transcript.",
    "probe": "Scripts/repro/766-modeling-boolean-expansion/probe-evidence-fix.mm (transcript-evidence-fix.txt)"
  },
  {
    "test_name": "v0.115.0 - Boolean Expansion::splitMulti",
    "bridge_function": "OCCTBooleanSplitMulti",
    "bridge_output": {
      "type": "value",
      "data": {
        "done": true,
        "solids": 2,
        "volume": 8000,
        "smallSolidVolume": 124.99999999999997,
        "largeSolidVolume": 7875.000000000002
      }
